<title>JAPAN: FUJI TV BID-ONLY EARLY IN MORNING OF DEBUT.</title>
<headline>FUJI TV BID-ONLY EARLY IN MORNING OF DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Television Network Inc shares were bid-only early on Friday, the day of the shares' debut on the Tokyo stock exchange.</p>
<p>The listing is the first nearly four decades by a Japanese television network.</p>
<p>As of 0001 GMT, the shares were bid-only at 550,000 yen, or the initial offer price of the shares.</p>
<p>Sell orders totalled 4,600 while buys stood at 66,000.</p>
</text>
